<title>USA: Allmerica Financial Corp Q1 net with charge.</title>
<headline>Allmerica Financial Corp Q1 net with charge.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ALLMERICA FINANCIAL CORPORATION</p>
<p>			(In millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>						Quarter ended March 31</p>
<p>						  1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net income(A)				$15.9	  $47.3</p>
<p> Net income per share			0.32	   0.94</p>
<p> Net operating income per share	 $0.66	  $0.51</p>
<p>Net realized gains per share on</p>
<p>investments, net of applicable</p>
<p>federal income taxes, minority</p>
<p>  interest and amortization		0.36	   0.41</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		   50.1	   50.1</p>
<p>NOTE: (A) Q1 1997 includes $17.7 million of after- tax net realized investment gains, net of minority interest, and a $35.0 million charge related to the transfer of the Company's disability income block, net of tax.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 includes $20.8 million in net realized investment gains, net of taxes and minority interest, and $1.0 million received in connection with the sale of a mutual fund servicing business, net of tax.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
